# 16-Bar Classic Rock Form in 4/4 (Mixolydian Verse + Anthem Chorus)

name = Classic Rock 4/4
genre = ROCK 4/4
examples = Sweet Home Alabama, Born to Be Wild, Fortunate Son
meter = 4/4
bpm = 120
